The files below implement the node within its granted authority. The body reads the subscription list from the `subscriptions` store under the key `urls`, falling back to `subscriptions`. It accepts either a JSON array of strings or newline-separated text with `#` comments. It trims entries and removes duplicates while keeping their order.

